# Hy4-flash Q4_K_M (168 GB) on the DGX Spark at the serving defaults: the plan holds all 20,992 routed experts on GB10's
# unified memory (89.5 GB) beside the trunk and the context, no host tier. The term with a derivation is the decode at depth
